functional_scenario.func_scenario:
Initial actions: 

(V1): V1 drives on Lane 4 at 95 km/h, approximately 120 m before the curve, maintaining a steady speed;
(V2): V2 drives on Lane 4, 18 m ahead of V1, at 85 km/h;
(V3): V3 drives on Lane 3, slightly behind V2 by about 5 m, at 70 km/h;
(V4): V4 drives on Lane 2, 25 m behind V3, at 88 km/h.


Interactive pattern sequence: 

(V3, V2): V3 swerve right into Lane 4, decreasing the distance between V3 and V2 to approximately 10 m;
(V2, V1): V2 decelerate from 85 km/h to approximately 65 km/h as V3 cuts in front;
(V1, V2): V1 brake and swerve left as V2 decelerates, reducing the distance between V1 and V2 to less than 10 m;
(V2, V1): V2 brake further from 65 km/h to approximately 55 km/h as V1 approaches rapidly.

